<view class="page"><view class="title">站内更新</view><view class="muted">打开页面时约每分钟更新，网络不畅会稍后重试；关闭后不会自动响铃。微信、短信和邮件提醒尚未开通。</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view>本站内未读 {{unread}} · 更新 {{total}}</view><view>{{notice}} 未读不等于待办。</view><view class="card" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="event_key"><view>{{item.read_at?'已读':'未读'}} · {{item.title}}</view><view>{{item.time}} · 当次状态 {{item.statusLabel}}</view><button bindtap="open" data-key="{{item.event_key}}" disabled="{{busy}}">查看记录</button><button bindtap="mark" data-key="{{item.event_key}}" disabled="{{busy || item.read_at}}">这条已查看</button></view><button bindtap="previous" disabled="{{busy || page<=1}}">上一页更新</button><button bindtap="next" disabled="{{busy || page*50>=total}}">下一页更新</button><button bindtap="load" disabled="{{busy}}">刷新更新</button><button bindtap="back">返回</button></view>